OL,3,GNEWSANo radical change after
OL,4,Anationalisation, GWR says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Great Western Railway (GWR)
OL,7,Fhas said customers should not expect
OL,8,F"radically different" change ahead of
OL,9,Fthe company returning to public
OL,10,Fownership next month.
OL,12,FFrom 13 December 2026, a new company
OL,13,Fcalled Greater Western Railway Limited
OL,14,Fwill operate the services, replacing
OL,15,FFirst Greater Western Limited, as part
OL,16,Fof the government's plan to nationalise
OL,17,Fall rail services in England by 2027.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
