OL,3,GNEWSANo radical change after
OL,4,Anationalisation, GWR says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Gloucestershire's
OL,7,FYour Voice segment, GWR managing
OL,8,Fdirector Mark Hopwood said staff had
OL,9,Fbeen working hard behind the scenes to
OL,10,Fensure passengers do not notice too
OL,11,Fmuch change.
OL,13,F"Fundamentally, it's going to be the
OL,14,Fsame staff on the same trains at the
OL,15,Fsame stations," he said.
